{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Connecticut Nursing Home Reporting API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Read-only, static JSON API of Connecticut nursing home public records (CMS, CT DSS, CT DPH), precomputed by scripts/build_reporting_api.py and served from GitHub Pages at https://danbeem.xyz.\n\nSTATIC HOSTING NOTES\n- Every URL ends in .json and parameters are in the path. There is no ?q= or ?type= query string.\n- Search: download /api/v1/search-index.json and match the normalized `key` client-side.\n- Facility comparison: fetch two facility-comprehensive reports and compare them in the client.\n- Unknown ids return the host's 404 page (not JSON). Responses are CORS-open (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *) and CDN-cached. No authentication, no rate limits.\n- Data is rebuilt when site data is refreshed; see generated_at and data_as_of in every file.\n\nEVIDENCE RULES\n- Each finding has kind: confirmed_fact (value printed in a public record), calculated (arithmetic on confirmed facts; formula given), possible_association (shared entity, name or principal; NOT evidence of ownership, control or conflict of interest), investigative_question (something the data cannot answer).\n- evidence[] items carry agency, dataset, url, reporting_period, as_of, record_id and verification (source_record, source_record_unvalidated, derived, name_match_unverified).\n- Missing data is null plus an entry in missing_data[]. \"No record\" never means \"no problem\"; say \"not in these datasets\".\n- Public CMS / CT DSS / CT DPH data only. No resident or Ombudsman case data. Screening information, not findings of violations.",
    "license": {
      "name": "Public data compiled by danbeem.xyz; see sources in /api/v1/index.json"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://danbeem.xyz"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Catalog"
    },
    {
      "name": "Facilities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reports"
    },
    {
      "name": "Management companies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Search"
    }
  ],
  "externalDocs": {
    "description": "Human docs",
    "url": "https://danbeem.xyz/api/docs/"
  },
